OL,3,APilots taken to hospital, says Saudi
OL,4,Aairport, after reported cockpit
OL,5,Astabbing on Israel-bound flight
OL,6,
OL,7,FPassengers tell Israeli media a pilot
OL,8,Fon a Dubai-Tel Aviv flight was stabbed
OL,9,Fbefore the plane was diverted to Saudi
OL,10,FArabia - what we do, and don't, know
OL,12,FThe airport where the plane landed says
OL,13,Fboth the captain and first officer
OL,14,Fsustained injuries - but does not say
OL,15,Fhow. Both have been taken to hospital,
OL,16,Fit adds
OL,18,FYasmin Abukasis says her daughter, who
OL,19,Fwas on board, heard screaming as a
OL,20,Fpilot called for help
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
