OL,3,APilots taken to hospital, says Saudi
OL,4,Aairport, after reported cockpit
OL,5,Astabbing on Israel-bound flight
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnother tells journalists that
OL,8,Fpassengers helped tackle one of the
OL,9,Fpilots and tie him down, writes our
OL,10,Freporter in Jerusalem
OL,12,FThe Flydubai plane - which set off
OL,13,Fearly on Wednesday - signalled an
OL,14,Femergency code two hours into the
OL,15,Fflight, tracking website Flightradar24
OL,16,Fsays
OL,18,FIt then switched to a hijacking code
OL,19,Fbut later returned to a general
OL,20,Femergency signal - Israeli officials
OL,21,Ftell local media "a very serious
OL,22,Fdisaster was averted"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
