OL,3,APilots taken to hospital, says Saudi
OL,4,Aairport, after reported cockpit
OL,5,Astabbing on Israel-bound flight
OL,6,
OL,7,FData, examined by BBC Verify, shows how
OL,8,Fthe plane plummeted by 17,000ft
OL,9,F(5,200m) in less than two minutes - a
OL,10,Fpassenger says it was "very stressful"
